115","city":"CS1029","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[76,75,64,63,49,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"3000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1020805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1029","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[76,75,64,63,49,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3100","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1020805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1016","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[76,75,64,63,49,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"3100","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1020805"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"魏国武将，名将牵招之子，初仕陇西太守。姜维北伐期间曾援助过邓艾，后随其一同进攻蜀地，并大破绵竹。蜀国投降后，被封为蜀郡太守。晋时任扬州刺史，成功击退东吴大将丁奉的进攻。转任凉州刺史后，征讨鲜卑秃发树机能，在青山被围，兵败被杀。","tc":"魏國武將，名將牽招之子，初仕隴西太守。姜維北伐期間曾援助過鄧艾，后隨其一同進攻蜀地，并大破綿竹。蜀國投降后，被封為蜀郡太守。晉時任揚州刺史，成功擊退東吳大將丁奉的進攻。轉任涼州刺史后，征討鮮卑禿發樹機能，在青山被圍，兵敗被殺。","en":"Officer of Wei and son of the renowned general Qian Zhao, he initially served as Governor of Longxi. During Jiang Wei's Northern Expeditions, he reinforced Deng Ai's forces, and later joined Deng Ai in the invasion of Shu, dealing a crushing defeat to the enemy at Mianzhu. After Shu's surrender, he was appointed Governor of Shu Commandery. Under the Jin dynasty, he served as Lt. Governor of Yang Province and successfully repelled an offensive by the Eastern Wu general Ding Feng. Transferred to Lt. Governor of Liang Province, he campaigned against the Xianbei chieftain Tufa Shujineng, but was surrounded at Qingshan, defeated, and killed.","jp":"魏の武将で、名将・牽招の子。初め隴西太守を務めた。姜維の北伐の際には鄧艾を救援し、のちに鄧艾に従って蜀へ侵攻して綿竹を大いに破った。蜀が降伏した後は蜀郡太守に任じられた。晋の時代には揚州刺史となり、東呉の大将・丁奉の侵攻を撃退した。涼州刺史に転任後、鮮卑の禿髪樹機能を討伐するが、青山で包囲され、敗れて殺された。","kr":"위나라의 무장이자 명장 견초의 아들로, 처음에는 농서태수를 지냈다. 강유의 북벌 당시 등애를 도왔으며, 이후 등애를 따라 촉을 침공해 면죽에서 대승을 거두었다. 촉나라가 항복한 뒤 촉군태수로 임명되었다. 진나라 때에는 양주(揚州)자사를 지내며 동오의 대장 정봉의 침공을 성공적으로 격퇴했다. 이후 양주(涼州)자사로 전임하여 선비족의 독발수기능을 토벌하러 나섰으나, 청산에서 포위되어 패배하고 전사했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10490","remark":"","surname":"牵","surnameTc":"牽","surnameEn":"Qian","surnameJp":"牽","surnameKr":"견","surnameOther":"","name":"弘","nameTc":"弘","nameEn":"Hong","nameJp":"弘","nameKr":"홍","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"牵弘","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"243","city":"CS1029","gender":"0","rule":"76","force":"75","wise":"64","politics":"63","charm":"49","will":"70","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"4","willTalent":"8","weaponMaster":"21/68/21/21/21/16/50/21","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1005802","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1012205","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5100","battleSoulPoint":"4900","debateSoulPoint":"4000","strategy":"","strategy2":"","professions":"2/0/2/0/3/0/2/2/2/1/2/2/1/0/3/0/0/1/0/0/0/3/1/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"3","compatible":"26","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3100","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"224","show":"243","death":"271","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"0","weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1020805","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/1;2/1;25/1;3/1;21/1;38/1","father":"WJ10588/0","mother":"","children":"","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRela